[
  {
    "comment": "【认证方式】Cookie 登录态，不需要账号密码。使用登录 www.koolcenter.com 后的完整 Cookie 与同一浏览器 User-Agent，两项必须成对；推荐在已登录浏览器中用「QianDao Cookie Extractor」一键读取，手动复制时保留 Cookie 原文，不要解码或裁剪。\n\n【本模板做什么】只读访问酷友社首页、Discourse 当前会话接口和最新话题页，触发每日登录访问；不会发帖、点赞、修改资料或领取其他奖励。\n\n【成功判定】首页和最新页可正常打开，/session/current.json 在前后两次读取中都返回非空 current_user.username；出现 current_user=null 或单点登录页则失败。\n\n【失效处理】站点返回登录页、明确提示登录失效、验证码或安全验证，以及页面结构不再符合预期时，任务会失败关闭，不会伪造成功。重新登录 www.koolcenter.com 后成对获取 Cookie 与 User-Agent 即可，模板本身不需要修改。\n\n【补充说明】Cloudflare、人机验证、安全验证或 challenge 页面都会失败关闭。",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://www.koolcenter.com/",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{user_agent}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept-Language",
          "value": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "no-cache"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "酷友社|koolcenter",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "Just a moment|Checking your browser|Verify you are human|人机验证|安全验证|challenge-form|cf-challenge|cdn-cgi",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": []
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "读取 Discourse 当前会话接口，要求返回当前登录用户",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://www.koolcenter.com/session/current.json",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{user_agent}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept",
          "value": "application/json"
        },
        {
          "name": "Referer",
          "value": "https://www.koolcenter.com/"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "\"current_user\"\\s*:\\s*\\{[^}]*\"username\"\\s*:\\s*\"[^\"]+\"",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "\"current_user\"\\s*:\\s*null|Not Found|未登录|请登录|Just a moment|人机验证|安全验证",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "trust_level",
          "re": "\"trust_level\"\\s*:\\s*(\\d+)",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "访问最新话题页，记录每日登录访问",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://www.koolcenter.com/latest",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{user_agent}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept-Language",
          "value": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9"
        },
        {
          "name": "Referer",
          "value": "https://www.koolcenter.com/"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "最新|latest|topic",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "Just a moment|Checking your browser|Verify you are human|人机验证|安全验证|challenge-form|cf-challenge|cdn-cgi",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": []
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "再次读取当前会话接口，防止半失效 Cookie 被误报为成功",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://www.koolcenter.com/session/current.json",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{user_agent}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept",
          "value": "application/json"
        },
        {
          "name": "Referer",
          "value": "https://www.koolcenter.com/latest"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "\"current_user\"\\s*:\\s*\\{[^}]*\"username\"\\s*:\\s*\"[^\"]+\"",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "\"current_user\"\\s*:\\s*null|Not Found|未登录|请登录|Just a moment|人机验证|安全验证",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": []
    }
  }
]
